    {
      "id": "3eabcaa0-6072-4ad4-9a71-0192df1e8863",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "Wildfire Science and the Urban Interface, B.S. is offered through Extended Learning . Please see the 25-26 Catalog for more information.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>Wildfire Science and the Urban Interface, B.S. is offered through </em></strong><a href=\"https://www.csusm.edu/el/programs/science-technology/bachelor-of-science-wildfire-science/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><em>Extended Learning</em></strong></a><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>.</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p>Please see the <a href=\"https://catalog.csusm.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=11&amp;poid=2669&amp;returnto=1994\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">25-26 Catalog</a> for more information.</p>"
